msgstr "齒輪藝術品掛高一點。我的球棒有可能碰到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_GEARS_ART.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_GEARS_ART.2"
msgid "Whoever picked the gears art gets to dust it."
msgstr "誰挑的齒輪藝術品，以後誰來撣灰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_HUNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_HUNT.1"
msgid "Hang the hunt a little higher. My bat might catch it."
msgstr "狩獵掛高一點。我的球棒有可能碰到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_HUNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_HUNT.2"
msgid "The hunt can go on the wall. Just don't make me stand there admiring it."
msgstr "狩獵可以掛牆上。別讓我站那裡一直看就好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_MOSAIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_MOSAIC.1"
msgid "Whoever picked the mosaic gets to dust it."
msgstr "誰挑的鑲嵌工藝品，以後誰來撣灰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_MOSAIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_MOSAIC.2"
msgid "The mosaic can go on the wall. Just don't make me stand there admiring it."
msgstr "鑲嵌工藝品可以掛牆上。別讓我站那裡一直看就好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_NO_SMOKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_NO_SMOKING.1"
msgid "The no smoking can go on the wall. Just don't make me stand there admiring it."
msgstr "禁止吸菸標識可以掛牆上。別讓我站那裡一直看就好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_NO_SMOKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_NO_SMOKING.2"
msgid "Hang the no smoking a little higher. My bat might catch it."
msgstr "禁止吸菸標識掛高一點。我的球棒有可能碰到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_PERIODIC_TABLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_PERIODIC_TABLE.1"
msgid "Hang the periodic table a little higher. My bat might catch it."
msgstr "元素週期表掛高一點。我的球棒有可能碰到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_PERIODIC_TABLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_PERIODIC_TABLE.2"
msgid "Whoever picked the periodic table gets to dust it."
msgstr "誰挑的元素週期表，以後誰來撣灰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_PHOTO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_PHOTO.1"
msgid "The photo can go on the wall. Just don't make me stand there admiring it."
msgstr "照片可以掛牆上。別讓我站那裡一直看就好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_PHOTO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_PHOTO.2"
msgid "Hang the photo a little higher. My bat might catch it."
msgstr "照片掛高一點。我的球棒有可能碰到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_WREATH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_WREATH.1"
msgid "Whoever picked the wreath gets to dust it."
msgstr "誰挑的花環，以後誰來撣灰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_WREATH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_WREATH.2"
msgid "Hang the wreath a little higher. My bat might catch it."
msgstr "花環掛高一點。我的球棒有可能碰到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WOOD.1"
msgid "Can we move the planed wood column a little closer to the wall?"
msgstr "能把被刨平的木柱再往牆邊挪一點嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WOOD.2"
msgid "The planed wood column can stay there, as long as I don't have to move it again."
msgstr "被刨平的木柱放那裡吧。別再讓我搬就好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WOOD_CORNERBEAM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WOOD_CORNERBEAM.1"
msgid "Can we move the wooden corner post a little closer to the wall?"
msgstr "能把木角柱再往牆邊挪一點嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WOOD_CORNERBEAM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECO_WOOD_CORNERBEAM.2"
msgid "I could use the wooden corner post. Where are we putting it?"
msgstr "木角柱能用得上。我們要放在哪裡？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEED.1"
msgid "I need the deed of Home Ownership for this? Fine. Where do I sign?"
msgstr "這也要用到房產所有權證書？好吧，在哪裡簽名？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEED.2"
msgid "The deed of Home Ownership goes in my bag. That way I only have to get it once."
msgstr "房產所有權證書放我包裡。免得下次又要去拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEMOLITION_PERMIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEMOLITION_PERMIT.1"
msgid "The demolition permit goes in my bag. That way I only have to get it once."
msgstr "拆遷許可證放我包裡。免得下次又要去拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEMOLITION_PERMIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEMOLITION_PERMIT.2"
msgid "I need the demolition permit for this? Fine. Where do I sign?"
msgstr "這也要用到拆遷許可證？好吧，在哪裡簽名？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DISARMING_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DISARMING_KIT.1"
msgid "Somebody show me how the disarming tools works. Keep it short."
msgstr "誰給我演示一下陷阱拆除工具怎麼用。簡單說就好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DISARMING_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DISARMING_KIT.2"
msgid "Give me the disarming tools. Let me see how it feels to use it."
msgstr "把陷阱拆除工具給我。我試試順不順手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DISGUISEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DISGUISEHAT.1"
msgid "Think the shamlet mask goes with my uniform? I'm wearing it either way."
msgstr "假豬面具配我的制服嗎？反正我會戴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DISGUISEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DISGUISEHAT.2"
msgid "The shamlet mask can go on the hook when I get home."
msgstr "回家以後，假豬面具可以掛到鉤子上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_NETTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_NETTLE.1"
msgid "Find a spot for the nettle plant before the roots dry out."
msgstr "趁蕁麻簇的根還沒乾，先找塊地方種下去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_NETTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_NETTLE.2"
msgid "I didn't dig up the nettle plant to leave it in my bag."
msgstr "我費力挖出蕁麻簇，可不是為了放在包裡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBALL.1"
msgid "How much dung ball do we have now? I lost count."
msgstr "現在有多少糞球了？我數亂了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBALL.2"
msgid "I should make space in my bag for the dung ball."
msgstr "我應該在包裡給糞球騰點位置。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.DEAD.1"
msgid "The dung beetle won't be getting up again. Let's move on."
msgstr "屎殼郎不會再起來了。走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.DEAD.2"
msgid "The dung beetle hasn't moved since we got here. I think we're fine."
msgstr "從我們過來到現在，屎殼郎沒動過。應該沒事了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Is that a dung beetle? Hold still, I want a better look."
msgstr "那是屎殼郎嗎？別動，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "That dung beetle is hard to keep track of."
msgstr "一轉眼就找不到那隻屎殼郎了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Don't wake the dung beetle. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "別吵醒屎殼郎。我們一下就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "The dung beetle gets a nap in the middle of the day. Lucky."
msgstr "屎殼郎白天還能睡一覺。真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.UNDUNGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.UNDUNGED.1"
msgid "I think it lost something. No, I'm not helping it look."
msgstr "它好像把東西弄丟了。別讓我幫忙找。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.UNDUNGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.UNDUNGED.2"
msgid "No ball. I almost didn't recognize it."
msgstr "沒了糞球，我差點沒認出來。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGPILE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGPILE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That's staying right where I found it."
msgstr "我在哪裡看見它，就讓它留在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGPILE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGPILE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "If somebody needs that for the garden, they can come get it."
msgstr "種地的人有需要，就自己過來拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGPILE.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGPILE.PICKED.1"
msgid "We got what we needed. Please tell me that was enough."
msgstr "要的已經拿了。千萬別告訴我還不夠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGPILE.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUNGPILE.PICKED.2"
msgid "I can still smell it. Let's go."
msgstr "氣味還在。走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FABRIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FABRIC.1"
msgid "If we have any more cloth, put it with this batch."
msgstr "還有布的話，就放到這堆一起。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FABRIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FABRIC.2"
msgid "Sort the cloth out from the rest of the pile for me, will you?"
msgstr "能幫我把布從這堆東西里挑出來嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_THUNDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_THUNDER.1"
msgid "Sort the thunder feather out from the rest of the pile for me, will you?"
msgstr "能幫我把雷羽毛從這堆東西里挑出來嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_THUNDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_THUNDER.2"
msgid "How much thunder feather do we have now? I lost count."
msgstr "現在有多少雷羽毛了？我數亂了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEIJOADA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEIJOADA.1"
msgid "Hand me the feijoada. I haven't eaten since we left."
msgstr "把八寶飯遞給我。出門以後我還沒吃過東西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEIJOADA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEIJOADA.2"
msgid "Put the feijoada where I can reach it. I'll be hungry later."
msgstr "八寶飯放在我夠得著的地方。晚點我會餓。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_RAINFOREST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_RAINFOREST.1"
msgid "I wonder what the exotic flower looks like after a good rain."
msgstr "不知道下場雨以後，異域花朵會長成什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_RAINFOREST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_RAINFOREST.2"
msgid "If you're taking some exotic flower, leave a bit for later."
msgstr "要摘異域花朵的話，留點下次再來。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON.1"
msgid "I could eat that poison dartfrog legs after a little time over a fire."
msgstr "箭毒蛙腿上火烤一下，我就能吃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON.2"
msgid "We've got the poison dartfrog legs. Now someone's got to clean it."
msgstr "箭毒蛙腿到手了。現在還得有人收拾它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON_COOKED.1"
msgid "I had plans. Then somebody made cooked dartfrog legs."
msgstr "我原本還有事要做。現在有人做了熟箭毒蛙腿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON_COOKED.2"
msgid "Now that there's cooked dartfrog legs, can we stop for lunch?"
msgstr "既然有熟箭毒蛙腿了，能停下來吃飯嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.DEAD.1"
msgid "I think the poison dartfrog is done. I'm still not putting my hand near it."
msgstr "箭毒蛙應該已經死了。我還是不把手伸過去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.DEAD.2"
msgid "The poison dartfrog hasn't moved since we got here. I think we're fine."
msgstr "從我們過來到現在，箭毒蛙沒動過。應該沒事了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Hey, poison dartfrog. You don't have to come any closer."
msgstr "喂，箭毒蛙。你待在那邊就好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "That's a poison dartfrog. Stay over there, thanks."
msgstr "是箭毒蛙。麻煩待在那邊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Even the poison dartfrog found time to sleep. I should take notes."
msgstr "連箭毒蛙都能抽空睡覺。我該學學。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Don't wake the poison dartfrog. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "別吵醒箭毒蛙。我們一下就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GASCLOUD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GASCLOUD.1"
msgid "That stuff's thick enough to see. Go around."
msgstr "那團氣濃得都看得見了，繞過去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GASCLOUD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GASCLOUD.2"
msgid "Hold your breath if you have to go past it."
msgstr "非要從旁邊過就屏住呼吸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GASMASKHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GASMASKHAT.1"
msgid "The gas mask can go on the hook when I get home."
msgstr "回家以後，防毒面具可以掛到鉤子上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GASMASKHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GASMASKHAT.2"
msgid "Think the gas mask goes with my uniform? I'm wearing it either way."
msgstr "防毒面具配我的制服嗎？反正我會戴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIANTGRUB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIANTGRUB.1"
msgid "Let me get my bat before the giant grub gets any ideas."
msgstr "趁巨型蛆蟲還沒動靜，我先把球棒拿上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIANTGRUB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIANTGRUB.2"
msgid "I was having a quiet day till that giant grub showed up."
msgstr "那隻巨型蛆蟲來之前，我過得還蠻清靜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.DEAD.1"
msgid "The glowfly won't be getting up again. Let's move on."
msgstr "發光飛蟲不會再起來了。走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.DEAD.2"
msgid "The glowfly hasn't moved since we got here. I think we're fine."
msgstr "從我們過來到現在，發光飛蟲沒動過。應該沒事了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That glowfly is hard to keep track of."
msgstr "一轉眼就找不到那隻發光飛蟲了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Is that a glowfly? Hold still, I want a better look."
msgstr "那是發光飛蟲嗎？別動，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Even the glowfly found time to sleep. I should take notes."
msgstr "連發光飛蟲都能抽空睡覺。我該學學。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Don't wake the glowfly. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "別吵醒發光飛蟲。我們一下就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY_COCOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY_COCOON.1"
msgid "Something's tucked up inside. I'm not going to unwrap it."
msgstr "裡面裹著東西。我才不去拆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY_COCOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY_COCOON.2"
msgid "Leave it in the cocoon. I'll come back if it starts glowing."
msgstr "讓它待在繭裡。開始發光了再回來。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNAT.1"
msgid "That gnat swarm is hard to keep track of."
msgstr "一轉眼就找不到那隻蟲群了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNAT.2"
msgid "Is that a gnat swarm? Hold still, I want a better look."
msgstr "那是蟲群嗎？別動，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNATMOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNATMOUND.1"
msgid "Don't kick the mound. I don't want to meet the rest of them."
msgstr "別踢那堆土。我可不想見到剩下那群。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNATMOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNATMOUND.2"
msgid "There are enough gnats outside it already."
msgstr "在外面飛的小蟲已經夠多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE.1"
msgid "If you borrow my luxury machete, put it back where you found it."
msgstr "借我的黃金砍刀可以，用完放回原處。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE.2"
msgid "I'll be careful with the luxury machete. Stop looking at me like that."
msgstr "我會小心用黃金砍刀。別那樣看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDPAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDPAN.1"
msgid "I'll take the gold pan with me. Better than walking back for it."
msgstr "我把淘金盤帶上吧，省得走一半還得回來拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDPAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDPAN.2"
msgid "Anybody using the gold pan? I could use a turn."
msgstr "有人在用淘金盤嗎？我正想用一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLD_DUST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLD_DUST.1"
msgid "With gold dust in my pocket, I can at least go look in the shops."
msgstr "兜裡有砂金了，至少能去店裡看看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLD_DUST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLD_DUST.2"
msgid "Keep the gold dust somewhere it won't get lifted."
msgstr "把砂金放到不會被偷走的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRABBING_VINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRABBING_VINE.1"
msgid "How much room do we have to go around the hanging vine?"
msgstr "繞開垂下的藤蔓還剩多少地方可走？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRABBING_VINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRABBING_VINE.2"
msgid "I saw the hanging vine. Let me get a little farther away first."
msgstr "我看見垂下的藤蔓了。先讓我退遠點。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.BURNING.1"
msgid "The tall grass caught fire. Somebody get water!"
msgstr "高草著火了！誰去拿點水！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.BURNING.2"
msgid "Do we have time to save the tall grass? That fire's getting bigger."
msgstr "現在還來得及救高草嗎？火越來越大了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "If you're taking some tall grass, leave a bit for later."
msgstr "要摘高草的話，留點下次再來。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder what the tall grass looks like after a good rain."
msgstr "不知道下場雨以後，高草會長成什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.PICKED.1"
msgid "Nothing left on the tall grass for now. Give it time."
msgstr "高草暫時採不出東西了。再等等吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.PICKED.2"
msgid "We can come back for the tall grass after it's had some time to grow."
msgstr "等高草長好了，我們可以再來。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUMMY_CAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUMMY_CAKE.1"
msgid "The gummy cake can cool off while I find somewhere to sit."
msgstr "先讓軟糖蛋糕涼一涼。我去找個地方坐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUMMY_CAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUMMY_CAKE.2"
msgid "Now that there's gummy cake, can we stop for lunch?"
msgstr "既然有軟糖蛋糕了，能停下來吃飯嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALBERD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALBERD.1"
msgid "Let me get a feel for the halberd before anything comes after us."
msgstr "趁還沒東西追過來，讓我先試試戟的手感。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALBERD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALBERD.2"
msgid "Stand back a little. I want to see what the halberd can do."
msgstr "後退一點。我想看看戟好不好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANGING_VINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANGING_VINE.1"
msgid "I'll leave the hanging vine alone today. It can keep growing."
msgstr "今天先不動垂下的藤蔓。讓它接著長吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANGING_VINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANGING_VINE.2"
msgid "There's some hanging vine growing here. Watch where you step."
msgstr "這裡長著垂下的藤蔓。走路當心腳下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARDSHELL_TACOS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARDSHELL_TACOS.1"
msgid "The hard shell tacos can cool off while I find somewhere to sit."
msgstr "先讓硬殼玉米餅涼一涼。我去找個地方坐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARDSHELL_TACOS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARDSHELL_TACOS.2"
msgid "I had plans. Then somebody made hard shell tacos."
msgstr "我原本還有事要做。現在有人做了硬殼玉米餅。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Do we have time to save the hedge? That fire's getting bigger."
msgstr "現在還來得及救樹籬嗎？火越來越大了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNING.2"
msgid "That's smoke coming off the hedge. Back up a little."
msgstr "是樹籬在冒煙。往後退一點。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNT.1"
msgid "So much for the hedge. Is anything under the ash still good?"
msgstr "樹籬算是完了。灰底下還有能用的東西嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNT.2"
msgid "The hedge is pretty much ash now. Leave it to cool."
msgstr "樹籬燒得差不多隻剩灰了。等它涼了再說。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'm looking at the hedge. That's all I'm doing. Relax."
msgstr "我就看看樹籬。不會亂碰，放心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Don't make me carry the hedge all the way back here if you change your mind."
msgstr "你要是改主意，別讓我把樹籬再搬回來。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.SHAVEABLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.SHAVEABLE.1"
msgid "Don't make me carry the hedge all the way back here if you change your mind."
msgstr "你要是改主意，別讓我把樹籬再搬回來。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.SHAVEABLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.SHAVEABLE.2"
msgid "Can we set the hedge down somewhere it won't get knocked over?"
msgstr "能把樹籬放在碰不倒的地方嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_BLOCK_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_BLOCK_ITEM.1"
msgid "Keep that block hedge. I might need it later."
msgstr "方形樹籬先留著。晚點我可能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_BLOCK_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_BLOCK_ITEM.2"
msgid "How much block hedge do we have now? I lost count."
msgstr "現在有多少方形樹籬了？我數亂了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_CONE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_CONE_ITEM.1"
msgid "Keep that cone hedge. I might need it later."
msgstr "錐形樹籬先留著。晚點我可能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_CONE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_CONE_ITEM.2"
msgid "Sort the cone hedge out from the rest of the pile for me, will you?"
msgstr "能幫我把錐形樹籬從這堆東西里挑出來嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_LAYERED_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_LAYERED_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll carry the layered hedge if somebody else carries the rest."
msgstr "其他東西誰拿一下，多層樹籬我來帶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_LAYERED_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_LAYERED_ITEM.2"
msgid "If we have any more layered hedge, put it with this batch."
msgstr "還有多層樹籬的話，就放到這堆一起。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIPPOPOTAMOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIPPOPOTAMOOSE.1"
msgid "That thing's built to take up the whole river."
msgstr "它光站著就能佔掉整條河。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIPPOPOTAMOOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIPPOPOTAMOOSE.2"
msgid "Big antlers. Bigger mouth. I'll let it go first."
msgstr "角很大，嘴更大。讓它先走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIPPO_ANTLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIPPO_ANTLER.1"
msgid "If we have any more hippopotamoose antler, put it with this batch."
msgstr "還有河鹿角的話，就放到這堆一起。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIPPO_ANTLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIPPO_ANTLER.2"
msgid "Keep that hippopotamoose antler. I might need it later."
msgstr "河鹿角先留著。晚點我可能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOGUSPORKUSATOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOGUSPORKUSATOR.1"
msgid "I'm looking at the hogus porkusator. That's all I'm doing. Relax."
msgstr "我就看看石豬引擎。不會亂碰，放心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOGUSPORKUSATOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOGUSPORKUSATOR.2"
msgid "Don't make me carry the hogus porkusator all the way back here if you change your mind."
msgstr "你要是改主意，別讓我把石豬引擎再搬回來。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEDTEA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEDTEA.1"
msgid "The iced tea smells good. I get the first bite, right?"
msgstr "冰茶聞起來不錯。我可以吃第一口吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEDTEA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEDTEA.2"
msgid "The iced tea can cool off while I find somewhere to sit."
msgstr "先讓冰茶涼一涼。我去找個地方坐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INFUSED_IRON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INFUSED_IRON.1"
msgid "I'll carry the infused iron if somebody else carries the rest."
msgstr "其他東西誰拿一下，注能鐵塊我來帶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INFUSED_IRON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INFUSED_IRON.2"
msgid "I should make space in my bag for the infused iron."
msgstr "我應該在包裡給注能鐵塊騰點位置。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_CHECK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_CHECK.1"
msgid "Lay the checkered flooring first. Then we can decide where everything goes."
msgstr "先鋪棋盤地板，再決定東西都放哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_CHECK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_CHECK.2"
msgid "I like the checkered flooring. Especially if I don't have to be the one sweeping it."
msgstr "我蠻喜歡棋盤地板。要是不用我掃就更好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_GARDENSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_GARDENSTONE.1"
msgid "I like the garden stone flooring. Especially if I don't have to be the one sweeping it."
msgstr "我蠻喜歡花園石地板。要是不用我掃就更好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_GARDENSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_GARDENSTONE.2"
msgid "Will the garden stone flooring show every dirty footprint? I'm asking for myself."
msgstr "花園石地板會不會把每個髒腳印都顯出來？我這是替自己問的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_GEOMETRICTILES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_GEOMETRICTILES.1"
msgid "Will the geometric tiles flooring show every dirty footprint? I'm asking for myself."
