#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIKO_ORANGE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIKO_ORANGE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That orange piko is hard to keep track of."
msgstr "一轉眼就找不到那隻橙色異食松鼠了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIKO_ORANGE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIKO_ORANGE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Is that an orange piko? Hold still, I want a better look."
msgstr "那是橙色異食松鼠嗎？別動，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIKO_ORANGE.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIKO_ORANGE.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Even the orange piko found time to sleep. I should take notes."
msgstr "連橙色異食松鼠都能抽空睡覺。我該學學。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIKO_ORANGE.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIKO_ORANGE.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Don't wake the orange piko. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "別吵醒橙色異食松鼠。我們一下就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PILLAR_DOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PILLAR_DOOR.1"
msgid "I'll go through the gothic door. Tell me if it's the wrong room."
msgstr "我從哥特式大門進去。房間走錯了就告訴我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PILLAR_DOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PILLAR_DOOR.2"
msgid "Leave the gothic door shut if you go out. I'm trying to keep it quiet in here."
msgstr "出去時把哥特式大門關上。我想讓這裡安靜一點。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PITHHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PITHHAT.1"
msgid "How am I going to keep the pith hat from falling off?"
msgstr "我要怎麼戴，軟木帽才不會掉？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PITHHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PITHHAT.2"
msgid "Think the pith hat goes with my uniform? I'm wearing it either way."
msgstr "軟木帽配我的制服嗎？反正我會戴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLATE_DOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLATE_DOOR.1"
msgid "Leave the industrial door shut if you go out. I'm trying to keep it quiet in here."
msgstr "出去時把工業大門關上。我想讓這裡安靜一點。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLATE_DOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLATE_DOOR.2"
msgid "I'll go through the industrial door. Tell me if it's the wrong room."
msgstr "我從工業大門進去。房間走錯了就告訴我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.BURNT.1"
msgid "The slanty shanty is pretty much ash now. Leave it to cool."
msgstr "歪斜的小木屋燒得差不多隻剩灰了。等它涼了再說。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.BURNT.2"
msgid "So much for the slanty shanty. Is anything under the ash still good?"
msgstr "歪斜的小木屋算是完了。灰底下還有能用的東西嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.FORSALE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.FORSALE.1"
msgid "It needs work. That had better mean it costs less."
msgstr "房子還得修。最好能因此便宜點。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.FORSALE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.FORSALE.2"
msgid "I could live there, if the price leaves me enough for dinner."
msgstr "要是買完還剩得下晚餐錢，我倒是能住這裡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.SOLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.SOLD.1"
msgid "It's mine now. I get to decide when the lights go out."
msgstr "現在歸我了。什麼時候關燈，我說了算。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.SOLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.SOLD.2"
msgid "I have a front door and nobody telling me to stand up straight. Good."
msgstr "有自己的門了，也沒人叫我站直。蠻好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_BRICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_BRICK.1"
msgid "I could wait by the brick house, if we're stopping here."
msgstr "如果要在這裡停一下，我可以在磚房旁邊等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_BRICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_BRICK.2"
msgid "I can see the brick house from here. Want to go look?"
msgstr "從這裡能看見磚房。要過去看看嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_BRICK_CRAFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_BRICK_CRAFT.1"
msgid "I can see the brick home kit from here. Want to go look?"
msgstr "從這裡能看見磚房套件。要過去看看嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_BRICK_CRAFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_BRICK_CRAFT.2"
msgid "If I lose you, meet me by the brick home kit."
msgstr "要是走散了，就在磚房套件旁邊碰面。"

