msgstr "要是走散了，就在帶塔樓的房屋旁邊碰面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET.2"
