msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET_CRAFT.1"
msgid "I can see the turreted home kit from here. Want to go look?"
msgstr "從這裡能看見角塔房屋套件。要過去看看嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET_CRAFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET_CRAFT.2"
msgid "I could wait by the turreted home kit, if we're stopping here."
msgstr "如果要在這裡停一下，我可以在角塔房屋套件旁邊等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA.1"
msgid "I can see the villa from here. Want to go look?"
msgstr "從這裡能看見別墅。要過去看看嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA.2"
msgid "That's the villa. I wonder if anyone's inside."
msgstr "那是別墅。不知道裡面有沒有人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA_CRAFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA_CRAFT.1"
