msgstr "現在有多少沙了？我數亂了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.DEAD.1"
msgid "The scorpion won't be getting up again. Let's move on."
msgstr "毒蠍不會再起來了。走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.DEAD.2"
msgid "The scorpion hasn't moved since we got here. I think we're fine."
msgstr "從我們過來到現在，毒蠍沒動過。應該沒事了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That's a scorpion. Stay over there, thanks."
msgstr "是毒蠍。麻煩待在那邊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I was having a quiet day till that scorpion showed up."
msgstr "那隻毒蠍來之前，我過得還蠻清靜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Don't wake the scorpion. We'll be gone in a minute."
msgstr "別吵醒毒蠍。我們一下就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "The scorpion gets a nap in the middle of the day. Lucky."
msgstr "毒蠍白天還能睡一覺。真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITYCONTRACT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITYCONTRACT.1"
msgid "The security contract goes in my bag. That way I only have to get it once."
msgstr "保全合同放我包裡。免得下次又要去拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITYCONTRACT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITYCONTRACT.2"
