msgstr "這也要用到保全合同？好吧，在哪裡簽名？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEDIMENTPUDDLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEDIMENTPUDDLE.1"
