msgstr "別一腳踩進去。好東西可能在底下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHEARS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHEARS.1"
