msgstr "備用裝備放在木刻書架上吧。再往高處放，我就忘了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELF_WOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELF_WOOD.2"
msgid "Leave the edge of the carved bookshelf clear. That's where my bag goes."
msgstr "木刻書架邊上留點地方。我的包放那裡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUGBUG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUGBUG.1"
msgid "I'll leave the gummy slug alone if it leaves me alone."
msgstr "只要糖蛞蝓不來打擾我，我也不去打擾它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUGBUG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUGBUG.2"
msgid "Look, a gummy slug. Try not to scare it off."
msgstr "看，有糖蛞蝓。別把它嚇跑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUGBUG_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUGBUG_COOKED.1"
msgid "Now that there's cooked gummy slug, can we stop for lunch?"
msgstr "既然有熟糖蛞蝓了，能停下來吃飯嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUGBUG_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUGBUG_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll try the cooked gummy slug. Save me a bite."
msgstr "熟糖蛞蝓我想試試。給我留一口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMASHINGPOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMASHINGPOT.1"
msgid "I can see exactly where I'd hit it. May I?"
msgstr "我連從哪裡打都想好了。可以嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMASHINGPOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMASHINGPOT.2"
msgid "Break this one? You don't have to ask me twice."
msgstr "這個可以砸？不用說第二遍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.BURNT.1"
msgid "So much for the smelter. Is anything under the ash still good?"
msgstr "煉鋼爐算是完了。灰底下還有能用的東西嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.BURNT.2"
msgid "The smelter is pretty much ash now. Leave it to cool."
msgstr "煉鋼爐燒得差不多隻剩灰了。等它涼了再說。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.COOKING_SHORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.COOKING_SHORT.1"
msgid "The smelter is running. Can I sit down now?"
msgstr "煉鋼爐運轉起來了。我現在能坐下了嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.COOKING_SHORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.COOKING_SHORT.2"
msgid "I'll leave the smelter on until it's done."
msgstr "讓煉鋼爐開著吧，等它忙完再關。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.DONE.1"
msgid "It's finished. I'll get something to handle the hot metal."
msgstr "煉好了。我去拿個東西夾熱鐵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.DONE.2"
msgid "Finally. Clear a spot for the ingots."
msgstr "總算好了。騰個地方放鐵錠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.EMPTY.1"
msgid "The smelter is empty. Did anybody bring what goes in it?"
msgstr "煉鋼爐是空的。該放進去的東西有人帶嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMELTER.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I'm leaving the smelter empty till I find something for it."
msgstr "等我找到合適的東西再裝進煉鋼爐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEBONESOUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEBONESOUP.1"
msgid "Now that there's snake bone soup, can we stop for lunch?"
msgstr "既然有蛇骨湯了，能停下來吃飯嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEBONESOUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEBONESOUP.2"
msgid "The snake bone soup can cool off while I find somewhere to sit."
msgstr "先讓蛇骨湯涼一涼。我去找個地方坐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL.1"
msgid "If it fixes everything, why's the bottle still full?"
msgstr "真有那麼神，瓶子怎麼還是滿的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL.2"
msgid "I'll believe the label when it gets rid of my homework."
msgstr "它要能幫我把作業弄沒，我就信瓶上寫的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN.1"
msgid "Keep that snakeskin. I might need it later."
msgstr "蛇皮先留著。晚點我可能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN.2"
msgid "I'll carry the snakeskin if somebody else carries the rest."
msgstr "其他東西誰拿一下，蛇皮我來帶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT.1"
msgid "Think the snakeskin hat goes with my uniform? I'm wearing it either way."
msgstr "蛇皮帽配我的制服嗎？反正我會戴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT.2"
msgid "I'll try the snakeskin hat on. Does it flatten my hair?"
msgstr "我戴一下蛇皮帽。會把頭髮壓扁嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_AMPHIBIOUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_AMPHIBIOUS.1"
msgid "Leave some room between us and that viper."
msgstr "和那隻蝰蛇保持點距離。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_AMPHIBIOUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_AMPHIBIOUS.2"
msgid "Hey, viper. You don't have to come any closer."
msgstr "喂，蝰蛇。你待在那邊就好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_BONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_BONE.1"
msgid "If we have any more snake bone, put it with this batch."
msgstr "還有蛇骨的話，就放到這堆一起。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_BONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_BONE.2"
msgid "Sort the snake bone out from the rest of the pile for me, will you?"
msgstr "能幫我把蛇骨從這堆東西里挑出來嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY.DEAD.1"
msgid "I think the spider monkey is done. I'm still not putting my hand near it."
msgstr "蜘蛛猴應該已經死了。我還是不把手伸過去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY.DEAD.2"
msgid "The spider monkey hasn't moved since we got here. I think we're fine."
msgstr "從我們過來到現在，蜘蛛猴沒動過。應該沒事了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I've got the spider monkey. Which lock takes it?"
msgstr "蜘蛛猴拿到了。它能開什麼鎖？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "One spider monkey. I hope finding the lock takes less time."
msgstr "蜘蛛猴到手。希望找鎖能快一點。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Even the spider monkey found time to sleep. I should take notes."
msgstr "連蜘蛛猴都能抽空睡覺。我該學學。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "The spider monkey gets a nap in the middle of the day. Lucky."
msgstr "蜘蛛猴白天還能睡一覺。真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_NEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_NEST.1"
msgid "I've got the spider monkey nest. Which lock takes it?"
msgstr "蜘蛛猴巢拿到了。它能開什麼鎖？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_NEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_NEST.2"
msgid "One spider monkey nest. I hope finding the lock takes less time."
msgstr "蜘蛛猴巢到手。希望找鎖能快一點。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_TREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_TREE.1"
msgid "One cocooned tree. I hope finding the lock takes less time."
msgstr "布滿蛛網的樹到手。希望找鎖能快一點。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_TREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_TREE.2"
msgid "I've got the cocooned tree. Which lock takes it?"
msgstr "布滿蛛網的樹拿到了。它能開什麼鎖？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPRINKLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPRINKLER.1"
msgid "Anybody using the sprinkler? I could use a turn."
msgstr "有人在用灑水器嗎？我正想用一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPRINKLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPRINKLER.2"
msgid "I'll be careful with the sprinkler. Stop looking at me like that."
msgstr "我會小心用灑水器。別那樣看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMSANDWICH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMSANDWICH.1"
msgid "Hand me the steamed ham sandwich. I haven't eaten since we left."
msgstr "把蒸火腿三明治遞給我。出門以後我還沒吃過東西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMSANDWICH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMSANDWICH.2"
msgid "I'll try the steamed ham sandwich. Save me a bite."
msgstr "蒸火腿三明治我想試試。給我留一口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_DOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_DOOR.1"
msgid "I'll go through the stone archway. Tell me if it's the wrong room."
msgstr "我從石拱門進去。房間走錯了就告訴我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_DOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_DOOR.2"
msgid "Leave the stone archway shut if you go out. I'm trying to keep it quiet in here."
msgstr "出去時把石拱門關上。我想讓這裡安靜一點。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_RELIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_RELIC.1"
msgid "Someone kept this sunken object for a reason. I wonder why."
msgstr "有人特地留著這個沉沒的物品。不知道為什麼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_RELIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_RELIC.2"
msgid "I'll put the sunken object in my pocket. I can decide what to do with it later."
msgstr "沉沒的物品先揣兜裡。晚點再想怎麼處理。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT1.1"
msgid "Does the hanging lamp have to be that bright when I'm trying to rest?"
msgstr "我正要休息，吊燈非得這麼亮嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT1.2"
msgid "Point the hanging lamp this way a little. That's better."
msgstr "把吊燈往這邊照一點。這樣好多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_BASIC_BULB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_BASIC_BULB.1"
msgid "Does the wired bulb have to be that bright when I'm trying to rest?"
msgstr "我正要休息，詭異電燈非得這麼亮嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_BASIC_BULB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_BASIC_BULB.2"
msgid "Leave the wired bulb on till I find my shoes."
msgstr "等我找到鞋再關詭異電燈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_BASIC_METAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_BASIC_METAL.1"
msgid "Does the metal shade lamp have to be that bright when I'm trying to rest?"
msgstr "我正要休息，金屬電燈非得這麼亮嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_BASIC_METAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_BASIC_METAL.2"
msgid "Leave the metal shade lamp on till I find my shoes."
msgstr "等我找到鞋再關金屬電燈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_CHANDALIER_CANDLES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_CHANDALIER_CANDLES.1"
msgid "Does the chandelier have to be that bright when I'm trying to rest?"
msgstr "我正要休息，吊燈非得這麼亮嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_CHANDALIER_CANDLES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_CHANDALIER_CANDLES.2"
msgid "Leave the chandelier on till I find my shoes."
msgstr "等我找到鞋再關吊燈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_DERBY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_DERBY.1"
msgid "Point the derby light this way a little. That's better."
msgstr "把帽燈往這邊照一點。這樣好多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_DERBY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_DERBY.2"
msgid "Switch on the derby light. I can't see what I'm doing."
msgstr "把帽燈打開。我看不見手上的東西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_BLOOMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_BLOOMER.1"
msgid "Does the hanging floral lamp have to be that bright when I'm trying to rest?"
msgstr "我正要休息，花燈非得這麼亮嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_BLOOMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_BLOOMER.2"
msgid "Switch on the hanging floral lamp. I can't see what I'm doing."
msgstr "把花燈打開。我看不見手上的東西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_BULB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_BULB.1"
msgid "If the blown glass bulb is for reading, it can wait till tomorrow."
msgstr "要是玻璃花燈是用來看書的，那就明天再開吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_BULB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_BULB.2"
msgid "Switch on the blown glass bulb. I can't see what I'm doing."
msgstr "把玻璃花燈打開。我看不見手上的東西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_SCALLOP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_SCALLOP.1"
msgid "Does the hanging blooming lamp have to be that bright when I'm trying to rest?"
msgstr "我正要休息，美麗花燈非得這麼亮嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_SCALLOP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_SCALLOP.2"
msgid "Point the hanging blooming lamp this way a little. That's better."
msgstr "把美麗花燈往這邊照一點。這樣好多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_PENDANT_CHERRIES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_PENDANT_CHERRIES.1"
msgid "Point the cherry lamp shade this way a little. That's better."
msgstr "把櫻桃燈往這邊照一點。這樣好多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_PENDANT_CHERRIES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_PENDANT_CHERRIES.2"
msgid "Does the cherry lamp shade have to be that bright when I'm trying to rest?"
msgstr "我正要休息，櫻桃燈非得這麼亮嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_ROPE_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_ROPE_1.1"
msgid "Point the rope light this way a little. That's better."
msgstr "把繩索吊燈往這邊照一點。這樣好多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_ROPE_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_ROPE_1.2"
msgid "Does the rope light have to be that bright when I'm trying to rest?"
msgstr "我正要休息，繩索吊燈非得這麼亮嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_ROPE_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_ROPE_2.1"
msgid "Switch on the dual rope light. I can't see what I'm doing."
msgstr "把雙繩吊燈打開。我看不見手上的東西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_ROPE_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_ROPE_2.2"
msgid "Leave the dual rope light on till I find my shoes."
msgstr "等我找到鞋再關雙繩吊燈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_TOPHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_TOPHAT.1"
msgid "Leave the top hat light on till I find my shoes."
msgstr "等我找到鞋再關高禮帽燈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_TOPHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_TOPHAT.2"
msgid "Point the top hat light this way a little. That's better."
msgstr "把高禮帽燈往這邊照一點。這樣好多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEA.1"
msgid "Now that there's tea, can we stop for lunch?"
msgstr "既然有茶了，能停下來吃飯嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEA.2"
msgid "The tea smells good. I get the first bite, right?"
msgstr "茶聞起來不錯。我可以吃第一口吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE.1"
msgid "I wonder what the tea tree looks like after a good rain."
msgstr "不知道下場雨以後，茶樹會長成什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE.2"
msgid "If you're taking some tea tree, leave a bit for later."
msgstr "要摘茶樹的話，留點下次再來。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT.1"
msgid "I'll carry the seed pod if somebody else carries the rest."
msgstr "其他東西誰拿一下，茶籽我來帶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT.2"
msgid "If we have any more seed pod, put it with this batch."
msgstr "還有茶籽的話，就放到這堆一起。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT_COOKED.1"
msgid "I had plans. Then somebody made cooked seed pod."
msgstr "我原本還有事要做。現在有人做了熟茶籽。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hand me the cooked seed pod. I haven't eaten since we left."
msgstr "把熟茶籽遞給我。出門以後我還沒吃過東西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT_SAPLING.1"
msgid "Give the tea tree sapling room to take root. I don't want to move it twice."
msgstr "給茶樹苗留夠紮根的地方。我可不想再挪一次。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT_SAPLING.2"
msgid "Come on, tea tree sapling. Grow before I forget where I put you."
msgstr "茶樹苗快長吧，免得我忘了種在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THUNDERBIRD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THUNDERBIRD.1"
msgid "Hear that crackle? Give it room."
msgstr "聽見噼啪聲了嗎？離它遠點。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THUNDERBIRD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THUNDERBIRD.2"
msgid "I felt that in my hair from over here."
msgstr "離這麼遠，我頭髮都開始豎了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THUNDERBIRDNEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THUNDERBIRDNEST.1"
msgid "Don't stick your hand in the thundernest. Something lives there."
msgstr "別把手伸進雷鳥巢。裡面住著東西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THUNDERBIRDNEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THUNDERBIRDNEST.2"
msgid "Keep quiet around the thundernest. I don't want anything coming out."
msgstr "經過雷鳥巢的時候小點聲。我可不想把裡面的東西引出來。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THUNDERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THUNDERHAT.1"
msgid "The thunderhat can go on the hook when I get home."
msgstr "回家以後，雷帽可以掛到鉤子上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THUNDERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THUNDERHAT.2"
msgid "Think the thunderhat goes with my uniform? I'm wearing it either way."
msgstr "雷帽配我的制服嗎？反正我會戴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPIARY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPIARY.1"
msgid "There's some intricate topiary growing here. Watch where you step."
msgstr "這裡長著雜亂的植物。走路當心腳下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPIARY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPIARY.2"
msgid "I wonder what the intricate topiary looks like after a good rain."
msgstr "不知道下場雨以後，雜亂的植物會長成什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN.1"
msgid "That toucan is hard to keep track of."
msgstr "一轉眼就找不到那隻大嘴鳥了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN.2"
msgid "Look, a toucan. Try not to scare it off."
msgstr "看，有大嘴鳥。別把它嚇跑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNET.1"
msgid "Put the trawl net where I can reach it from my seat."
msgstr "把拖網放到我坐著也夠得著的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNET.2"
msgid "If the trawl net comes loose at sea, I'm making you go get it."
msgstr "拖網要是在海上鬆脫了，我就讓你去撈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Get one end of the trawl net. I'll lift the other."
msgstr "你提拖網一頭，我抬另一頭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "What's in the trawl net? I want to see if we got anything good."
msgstr "拖網裡有什麼？我想看看有沒有好東西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOON.1"
msgid "Quick, pull the trawl net aboard. There isn't much of it left above water!"
msgstr "快把拖網拉上船。露出水面的部分不多了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOON.2"
msgid "If we leave the trawl net any longer, we're losing the whole catch."
msgstr "拖網再不收，一網東西都要沒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOONISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOONISH.1"
msgid "The trawl net is starting to sink. Let's work on getting it back."
msgstr "拖網開始往下沉了。想辦法收回來吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOONISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOONISH.2"
msgid "Bring us closer to the trawl net. It'll sink if we keep waiting."
msgstr "把船往拖網靠一點。再等下去就沉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_PILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_PILLAR.1"
msgid "I looked up till my neck hurt. Still couldn't see the top."
msgstr "抬頭抬得脖子都酸了，還是望不到頂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_PILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_PILLAR.2"
msgid "That's a lot of stalk between me and the sky."
msgstr "這麼大一根莖，把天都擋住了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_1.1"
msgid "I don't know what a queen malfalfa is worth here. I could ask."
msgstr "不知道瑪法拉法女王在這裡值多少。我可以去問問。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_1.2"
msgid "Don't lose the queen malfalfa now that we finally found it."
msgstr "好不容易找到瑪法拉法女王，別再弄丟了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_3.1"
msgid "I don't know what a post Card of the Royal Palace is worth here. I could ask."
msgstr "不知道皇室明信片在這裡值多少。我可以去問問。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_3.2"
msgid "Don't lose the post Card of the Royal Palace now that we finally found it."
msgstr "好不容易找到皇室明信片，別再弄丟了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_4.1"
msgid "I don't know what a can of Silly String is worth here. I could ask."
msgstr "不知道噴彩摩絲罐頭在這裡值多少。我可以去問問。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_4.2"
msgid "Don't lose the can of Silly String now that we finally found it."
msgstr "好不容易找到噴彩摩絲罐頭，別再弄丟了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUSTY_SHOOTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUSTY_SHOOTER.1"
msgid "I'm putting the pew-matic horn somewhere I won't step on it."
msgstr "我得把氣槍喇叭放到自己踩不到的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUSTY_SHOOTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUSTY_SHOOTER.2"
msgid "Let me get a feel for the pew-matic horn before anything comes after us."
msgstr "趁還沒東西追過來，讓我先試試氣槍喇叭的手感。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBERTREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBERTREE.1"
msgid "I'll leave the tuber tree alone today. It can keep growing."
msgstr "今天先不動塊莖樹。讓它接著長吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBERTREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBERTREE.2"
msgid "There's some tuber tree growing here. Watch where you step."
msgstr "這裡長著塊莖樹。走路當心腳下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP.1"
msgid "Keep that blooming tuber. I might need it later."
msgstr "開花塊莖先留著。晚點我可能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP.2"
msgid "Sort the blooming tuber out from the rest of the pile for me, will you?"
msgstr "能幫我把開花塊莖從這堆東西里挑出來嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'll try the fried blooming tuber. Save me a bite."
msgstr "煎開花塊莖我想試試。給我留一口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP_COOKED.2"
msgid "The fried blooming tuber can cool off while I find somewhere to sit."
msgstr "先讓煎開花塊莖涼一涼。我去找個地方坐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP.1"
msgid "I should make space in my bag for the tuber."
msgstr "我應該在包裡給塊莖騰點位置。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP.2"
msgid "How much tuber do we have now? I lost count."
msgstr "現在有多少塊莖了？我數亂了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP_COOKED.1"
msgid "The fried tuber smells good. I get the first bite, right?"
msgstr "煎塊莖聞起來不錯。我可以吃第一口吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP_COOKED.2"
msgid "I had plans. Then somebody made fried tuber."
msgstr "我原本還有事要做。現在有人做了煎塊莖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUNACAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUNACAN.1"
msgid "Tuna. All I need now is something to open the tin."
msgstr "鮪魚。現在就差個開罐的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUNACAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUNACAN.2"
msgid "Save it for when the shops are closed and I'm still hungry."
msgstr "等店關了、我又餓的時候再吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COBBLEROAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COBBLEROAD.1"
msgid "Let's lay the stone road turf before putting all the furniture back."
msgstr "先把石板路地皮鋪好，再把東西搬回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COBBLEROAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COBBLEROAD.2"
msgid "How much stone road turf do we need to cover that patch?"
msgstr "鋪滿那一塊要多少石板路地皮？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DEEPRAINFOREST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DEEPRAINFOREST.1"
msgid "The dense rainforest turf can go here. I'm tired of carrying it."
msgstr "茂密雨林地皮就鋪這裡吧。我搬累了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DEEPRAINFOREST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DEEPRAINFOREST.2"
msgid "Let's lay the dense rainforest turf before putting all the furniture back."
msgstr "先把茂密雨林地皮鋪好，再把東西搬回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DEEPRAINFOREST_NOCANOPY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DEEPRAINFOREST_NOCANOPY.1"
msgid "The dense turf can go here. I'm tired of carrying it."
msgstr "茂密地皮就鋪這裡吧。我搬累了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DEEPRAINFOREST_NOCANOPY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DEEPRAINFOREST_NOCANOPY.2"
msgid "Try a strip of dense turf by the door. See how it looks."
msgstr "門口鋪一條茂密地皮試試，看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FIELDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FIELDS.1"
msgid "Try a strip of cultivated turf by the door. See how it looks."
msgstr "門口鋪一條耕地地皮試試，看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FIELDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FIELDS.2"
msgid "The cultivated turf can go here. I'm tired of carrying it."
msgstr "耕地地皮就鋪這裡吧。我搬累了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOUNDATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOUNDATION.1"
msgid "How much flat stone turf do we need to cover that patch?"
msgstr "鋪滿那一塊要多少平整石地皮？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOUNDATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOUNDATION.2"
msgid "Let's lay the flat stone turf before putting all the furniture back."
msgstr "先把平整石地皮鋪好，再把東西搬回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_GASJUNGLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_GASJUNGLE.1"
msgid "Let's lay the toxic turf before putting all the furniture back."
msgstr "先把毒性地皮鋪好，再把東西搬回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_GASJUNGLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_GASJUNGLE.2"
msgid "The toxic turf can go here. I'm tired of carrying it."
msgstr "毒性地皮就鋪這裡吧。我搬累了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_LAWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_LAWN.1"
msgid "The lawn turf can go here. I'm tired of carrying it."
msgstr "草坪地皮就鋪這裡吧。我搬累了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_LAWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_LAWN.2"
msgid "Let's lay the lawn turf before putting all the furniture back."
msgstr "先把草坪地皮鋪好，再把東西搬回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSS.1"
msgid "The mossy turf can go here. I'm tired of carrying it."
msgstr "苔蘚地皮就鋪這裡吧。我搬累了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSS.2"
msgid "Try a strip of mossy turf by the door. See how it looks."
msgstr "門口鋪一條苔蘚地皮試試，看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PAINTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PAINTED.1"
msgid "How much painted sand turf do we need to cover that patch?"
msgstr "鋪滿那一塊要多少彩繪沙地皮？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PAINTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PAINTED.2"
msgid "Try a strip of painted sand turf by the door. See how it looks."
msgstr "門口鋪一條彩繪沙地皮試試，看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PIGRUINS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PIGRUINS.1"
msgid "Let's lay the ancient stone turf before putting all the furniture back."
msgstr "先把古代石地皮鋪好，再把東西搬回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PIGRUINS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PIGRUINS.2"
msgid "The ancient stone turf can go here. I'm tired of carrying it."
msgstr "古代石地皮就鋪這裡吧。我搬累了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PLAINS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PLAINS.1"
msgid "Let's lay the wild plains turf before putting all the furniture back."
msgstr "先把荒野平原地皮鋪好，再把東西搬回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PLAINS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PLAINS.2"
msgid "Try a strip of wild plains turf by the door. See how it looks."
msgstr "門口鋪一條荒野平原地皮試試，看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RAINFOREST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RAINFOREST.1"
msgid "Try a strip of rainforest turf by the door. See how it looks."
msgstr "門口鋪一條雨林地皮試試，看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RAINFOREST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RAINFOREST.2"
msgid "How much rainforest turf do we need to cover that patch?"
msgstr "鋪滿那一塊要多少雨林地皮？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.DEAD.1"
msgid "It came right at me. What did it expect?"
msgstr "它都直接衝過來了。我還能怎麼辦？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.DEAD.2"
msgid "That bat's grounded. We can put the lights away."
msgstr "這隻飛不起來了。燈可以收了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I like the kind of bat that stays in my hands."
msgstr "我比較喜歡能握在手裡的那種球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Get away from my neck. You can bite a tree for all I care."
msgstr "離我脖子遠點。要咬就去咬樹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "It finally stopped flapping. Let's go while it's still quiet."
msgstr "總算不撲騰了。趁它沒醒快走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "How does it sleep upside down? I'd get a headache."
msgstr "倒掛著怎麼睡？換我早就頭疼了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE.1"
msgid "Don't stick your hand in the cave cleft. Something lives there."
msgstr "別把手伸進洞穴裂縫。裡面住著東西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE.2"
msgid "Keep quiet around the cave cleft. I don't want anything coming out."
msgstr "經過洞穴裂縫的時候小點聲。我可不想把裡面的東西引出來。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BAT_WING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BAT_WING.1"
msgid "Sort the bat wing out from the rest of the pile for me, will you?"
msgstr "能幫我把蝙蝠翅膀從這堆東西里挑出來嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BAT_WING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BAT_WING.2"
msgid "I'll carry the bat wing if somebody else carries the rest."
msgstr "其他東西誰拿一下，蝙蝠翅膀我來帶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND.1"
msgid "Keep that venom gland. I might need it later."
msgstr "毒腺先留著。晚點我可能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND.2"
msgid "I should make space in my bag for the venom gland."
msgstr "我應該在包裡給毒腺騰點位置。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENUS_STALK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENUS_STALK.1"
msgid "If you're taking some flytrap stalk, leave a bit for later."
msgstr "要摘捕蠅草根的話，留點下次再來。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENUS_STALK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENUS_STALK.2"
msgid "I wonder what the flytrap stalk looks like after a good rain."
msgstr "不知道下場雨以後，捕蠅草根會長成什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VINE.1"
msgid "I'll carry the vine if somebody else carries the rest."
msgstr "其他東西誰拿一下，藤蔓我來帶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VINE.2"
msgid "How much vine do we have now? I lost count."
msgstr "現在有多少藤蔓了？我數亂了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGSTICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGSTICK.1"
msgid "If you borrow my stalking stick, put it back where you found it."
msgstr "借我的花莖手杖可以，用完放回原處。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGSTICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGSTICK.2"
msgid "I'll take the stalking stick with me. Better than walking back for it."
msgstr "我把花莖手杖帶上吧，省得走一半還得回來拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALLCRACK_RUINS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALLCRACK_RUINS.1"
msgid "I think I can see the suspicious crack from here. Hold up the light."
msgstr "從這裡好像能看到可疑的裂痕。把燈舉高。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALLCRACK_RUINS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALLCRACK_RUINS.2"
msgid "I want a closer look at the suspicious crack. Can you watch my back?"
msgstr "我想湊近看看可疑的裂痕。幫我留意身後好嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS.1"
msgid "Sort the ancient wall out from the rest of the pile for me, will you?"
msgstr "能幫我把古代牆壁從這堆東西里挑出來嗎？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS.2"
msgid "How much ancient wall do we have now? I lost count."
msgstr "現在有多少古代牆壁了？我數亂了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERDROP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERDROP.1"
msgid "I'll keep it till I know what to do with it. Try not to spill it."
msgstr "先留到弄清怎麼用再說。別灑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERDROP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERDROP.2"
msgid "That's a drop of magic, apparently. Good thing I didn't wipe it up."
msgstr "說是滴魔法水。還好我沒順手擦掉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE.1"
msgid "Keep the weevole out of my bag. My lunch is in there."
msgstr "別讓象鼻蟲鑽進我的包，午餐還在裡面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE.2"
msgid "One's a nuisance. I hope that's all of them."
msgstr "一隻就夠煩了。希望只剩這一隻。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE_CARAPACE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE_CARAPACE.1"
msgid "How much weevole carapace do we have now? I lost count."
msgstr "現在有多少象鼻鼠蟲殼了？我數亂了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE_CARAPACE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE_CARAPACE.2"
msgid "Keep that weevole carapace. I might need it later."
msgstr "象鼻鼠蟲殼先留著。晚點我可能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHEELER_TRACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHEELER_TRACKER.1"
msgid "Somebody show me how the navigadget works. Keep it short."
msgstr "誰給我演示一下導向儀怎麼用。簡單說就好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHEELER_TRACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHEELER_TRACKER.2"
msgid "Anybody using the navigadget? I could use a turn."
msgstr "有人在用導向儀嗎？我正想用一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_GREENHOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_GREENHOUSE.1"
msgid "Put a seat by the greenhouse wall. I'll tell you if anybody comes by."
msgstr "溫室落地窗邊上放張椅子吧。有人經過我就告訴你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_GREENHOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_GREENHOUSE.2"
msgid "I can see out through the greenhouse wall without getting up. That's handy."
msgstr "不用站起來就能從溫室落地窗看出去。蠻方便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE.1"
msgid "I think the square window needs a wipe. Or I just need glasses."
msgstr "方形窗戶該擦了吧。也可能只是我得戴眼鏡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE.2"
msgid "Put a seat by the square window. I'll tell you if anybody comes by."
msgstr "方形窗戶邊上放張椅子吧。有人經過我就告訴你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE_CURTAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE_CURTAIN.1"
msgid "Put a seat by the large square curtain window. I'll tell you if anybody comes by."
msgstr "大方形窗簾邊上放張椅子吧。有人經過我就告訴你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE_CURTAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE_CURTAIN.2"
msgid "The large square curtain window gets enough light in the afternoon. Maybe too much."
msgstr "下午從大方形窗簾照進來的光夠多了。甚至有點過頭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND.1"
msgid "I can see out through the round window without getting up. That's handy."
msgstr "不用站起來就能從圓窗看出去。蠻方便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND.2
