msgid "Put a seat by the peaked curtain window. I'll tell you if anybody comes by."
msgstr "橢圓窗簾邊上放張椅子吧。有人經過我就告訴你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_SMALL_PEAKED_CURTAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_SMALL_PEAKED_CURTAIN.2"
