msgstr "不用站起來就能從橢圓玻璃窗看出去。蠻方便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_TALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_TALL.2"
