msgstr "橢圓玻璃窗簾邊上放張椅子吧。有人經過我就告訴你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_DOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_DOOR.1"
msgid "I'll go through the hardwood door. Tell me if it's the wrong room."
msgstr "我從硬木門進去。房間走錯了就告訴我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_DOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_DOOR.2"
msgid "I keep forgetting which way the hardwood door opens."
msgstr "我總記不住硬木門朝哪邊開。"

